  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\">夜視效果</strong></span></span></h1>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>英文說明</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>想在黑暗中不用藥水也能看清嗎？這個材質包可以幫你實現。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>這個材質包讓你在無需藥水的情況下也能在黑暗中視物。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>洞穴裡看起來就像白天一樣明亮！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>這個材質包也被稱為<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">全亮度材質包。<br><br></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者 @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\"></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持作者 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegod%253fcountry.x%253dES%2526locale.x%253des_ES\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5db302.png\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\" width=\"211\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a7-a0a9-5c2642f644cb.png\" width=\"191\" height=\"56\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@d_de_diego_d\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Youtube Channel\" width=\"190\" height=\"55\"></a></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftridex.webnode.es%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_caf0ba8d-3249-447f-b3b8-6507248fbba5.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"57\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f%253frefid%253d871639\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_163a7545-bbf3-47c9-817b-4423c2d5688d.png\" width=\"204\" height=\"60\"></a> &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fd_de_diego_d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_99fae7f1-37c6-4d3f-9c4d-e13116617f73.png\" width=\"204\" height=\"60\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\"></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ⭐ 我們的專案⭐</strong></h2>\n<p>\n<!-- 專案圖片連結保持原樣 -->\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/visible-ores-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_80c5c834-7988-4194-8e81-217aacb8b723.png\" alt=\"可見礦石Plus\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/night-vision-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_99fa62dd-1530-4e94-ad61-621feb0a3775.png\" alt=\"夜視效果Plus\" width=\"125\" height=\"123\"></a>\n<!-- 其他專案圖片連結保持原樣 -->\n</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>© TRIDEX 2025 - 版權所有</p>",
